    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Hydraulic Ramp Loading</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Traditional winch-based loading often causes wheel slippage and tire scuffing. Our hydraulic ramps provide a smooth, mechanical incline that allows vehicles to drive onto the carrier deck with minimal effort. This method prevents sudden jerks and reduces friction between the tires and the ramp surface.</p>
