    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Edge Padding Application</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Exposure to sharp metal edges is a primary cause of accidental paint chips. We apply high-density foam padding to all contact points, including ramp edges, anchor posts, and deck boundaries. This creates a soft barrier between the vehicle’s bodywork and the hard steel infrastructure of the truck.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
