<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Lucknow to Mumbai | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does Car Transport From Lucknow To Mumbai usually take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical transit time for Car Transport From Lucknow To Mumbai ranges between 30 and 36 hours, depending on traffic conditions, weather, and any scheduled checkpoints along NH 19, NH 27 and NH 48. Our GPS‑enabled fleet provides real‑time updates, allowing you to monitor progress and anticipate the exact delivery window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures protect my vehicle from scratches during the Lucknow‑to‑Mumbai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a zero‑scratch safety suite that includes hydraulic ramp loading, 4‑wheel locking devices, high‑density edge padding, and a joint inspection before departure. Each car is secured on a dedicated container trailer, and our trained crew follows a strict checklist to eliminate any contact‑damage risk.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees in the Lucknow to Mumbai car transport quote?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are added after the quote is issued. The estimate covers fuel surcharge, handling fee, statutory taxes, and full‑value insurance. Any optional services—such as expedited delivery or additional packaging—are clearly listed, and you receive a final invoice that matches the quoted amount.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for RTO registration after my car reaches Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Upon arrival in Mumbai, you’ll need the original vehicle registration certificate, a copy of the insurance policy, the transport receipt, a no‑objection certificate from the sending RTO in Lucknow, and a valid address proof in Mumbai. Our team assists in preparing these papers to streamline the re‑registration process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Lucknow to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container trailer is equipped with satellite GPS tracking that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive a secure link to view the exact position of your car, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, ensuring complete transparency throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process work for my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp is positioned at ground level, and the driver gently guides the vehicle onto the ramp while a crew member aligns the wheels with the 4‑wheel lock. Once the car is on the ramp, the hydraulic system lifts it onto the container trailer, after which edge padding is applied before securing the lock.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the Car Transport From Lucknow To Mumbai service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that provides 100 % declared‑value coverage. The policy protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage during transit, and a copy of the insurance certificate is shared with you at the time of booking.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
